{
  "title": "Faster Onboarding for Front-Desk Staff",
  "notes": "create-deck SKILL.md templates copied verbatim (semantic --deck-* wrapper over --ds-* with system-color fallbacks). The renderer sets --ds-* on the canvas element, outside the slide HTML (a default design system renders even when the deck's designSystemId is null), so the body-mounted editor cannot resolve them.",
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "skill-title",
      "layout": "title",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg: var(--ds-bg, Canvas); --deck-ink: var(--ds-text, CanvasText); --deck-muted: var(--ds-text-muted, GrayText); --deck-accent: var(--ds-accent, currentColor); --deck-surface: var(--ds-surface, transparent); --deck-heading-font: var(--ds-heading-font, sans-serif); --deck-body-font: var(--ds-body-font, sans-serif); --deck-radius: var(--ds-radius, 0px); background: var(--deck-bg); color: var(--deck-ink); padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; font-family: var(--deck-body-font);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">Q4 Planning · Operations</div>\n  <h1 style=\"font-size: 56px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--deck-ink, var(--ds-text, currentColor)); font-family: var(--deck-heading-font, var(--ds-heading-font, var(--deck-body-font, sans-serif))); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 0; max-width: 760px;\">Cutting onboarding time for front-desk staff</h1>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 20px; color: var(--deck-muted, var(--ds-text-muted, currentColor)); margin: 4px 0 0;\">Jordan Lee · Northwind Resorts leadership review</p>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-two-column",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg: var(--ds-bg, Canvas); --deck-ink: var(--ds-text, CanvasText); --deck-muted: var(--ds-text-muted, GrayText); --deck-accent: var(--ds-accent, currentColor); --deck-surface: var(--ds-surface, transparent); --deck-heading-font: var(--ds-heading-font, sans-serif); --deck-body-font: var(--ds-body-font, sans-serif); --deck-radius: var(--ds-radius, 0px); background: var(--deck-bg); color: var(--deck-ink); padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 18px; font-family: var(--deck-body-font);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">The problem</div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size: 34px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--deck-ink, var(--ds-text, currentColor)); font-family: var(--deck-heading-font, var(--ds-heading-font, var(--deck-body-font, sans-serif))); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 18px;\">New hires take six weeks to reach full speed</h2>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: start;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n      <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor)); padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--deck-surface, var(--ds-surface, transparent)); border-radius: var(--deck-radius, var(--ds-radius, 0px)); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4;\">Training is shadowing only; nothing is written down</div>\n      <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor)); padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--deck-surface, var(--ds-surface, transparent)); border-radius: var(--deck-radius, var(--ds-radius, 0px)); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4;\">Each property runs its own checklist</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fmd-img-placeholder\" style=\"min-height: 220px; border-radius: var(--deck-radius, var(--ds-radius, 0px));\">Front-desk trainee checking in a guest while a supervisor watches</div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-metrics",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg: var(--ds-bg, Canvas); --deck-ink: var(--ds-text, CanvasText); --deck-muted: var(--ds-text-muted, GrayText); --deck-accent: var(--ds-accent, currentColor); --deck-surface: var(--ds-surface, transparent); --deck-heading-font: var(--ds-heading-font, sans-serif); --deck-body-font: var(--ds-body-font, sans-serif); --deck-radius: var(--ds-radius, 0px); background: var(--deck-bg); color: var(--deck-ink); padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 18px; font-family: var(--deck-body-font);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">Pilot results</div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size: 34px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--deck-ink, var(--ds-text, currentColor)); font-family: var(--deck-heading-font, var(--ds-heading-font, var(--deck-body-font, sans-serif))); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Two pilot properties, eight weeks</h2>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor)); padding-top: 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 44px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">19 days</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--deck-muted, var(--ds-text-muted, currentColor)); margin-top: 6px;\">to full speed, down from 42</div></div>\n    <div style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor)); padding-top: 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 44px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">−31%</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--deck-muted, var(--ds-text-muted, currentColor)); margin-top: 6px;\">check-in errors in month one</div></div>\n    <div style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor)); padding-top: 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 44px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">4.6 / 5</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--deck-muted, var(--ds-text-muted, currentColor)); margin-top: 6px;\">new-hire confidence score</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-closing",
      "layout": "statement",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg: var(--ds-bg, Canvas); --deck-ink: var(--ds-text, CanvasText); --deck-muted: var(--ds-text-muted, GrayText); --deck-accent: var(--ds-accent, currentColor); --deck-surface: var(--ds-surface, transparent); --deck-heading-font: var(--ds-heading-font, sans-serif); --deck-body-font: var(--ds-body-font, sans-serif); --deck-radius: var(--ds-radius, 0px); background: var(--deck-bg); color: var(--deck-ink); padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 16px; font-family: var(--deck-body-font);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deck-accent, var(--ds-accent, currentColor));\">The ask</div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--deck-ink, var(--ds-text, currentColor)); font-family: var(--deck-heading-font, var(--ds-heading-font, var(--deck-body-font, sans-serif))); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0; max-width: 720px;\">Roll the written program out to all nine properties by March</h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 20px; color: var(--deck-muted, var(--ds-text-muted, currentColor)); margin: 0;\">One trainer per region, no new headcount</p>\n</div>"
    }
  ]
